@@ -38,6 +38,17 @@ config SND_SUN50I_CODEC_ANALOG
 	  Say Y or M if you want to add support for the analog controls for
 	  the codec embedded in Allwinner A64 SoC.
 
+config SND_SUN20I_D1_CODEC_ANALOG
